<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112724" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσκη</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυσάω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the large intestine,</i> esp. as <i>stuffed with pudding,
				sausage, black-pudding,</i> gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσκης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					364
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				45
			</span></i>; pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσκαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					164
				</span></i>
			 (troch.); nom. sg. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					63.6
				</span></i>
			 (anap.), 
				Dor.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσκα</span> prob.a nickname, 'pot-belly',
				<i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
				23
			</span></i>; acc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philem.
					60.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>blister</i> or <i>weal on the hand,</i> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1114
			</span></i> (nom. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσκα</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>gall-bag</i> on a plant, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				22
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
